497
00:37:30,701 --> 00:37:34,220
Robert Stack was a world champion shot as a teenager.

498
00:37:36,700 --> 00:37:39,640
At sporting clubs and shooting ranges today,

499
00:37:39,641 --> 00:37:43,040
A new generation of celebrities like Tom Cruise,

500
00:37:43,041 --> 00:37:45,420
Steven Spielberg and Tom Selleck

501
00:37:45,421 --> 00:37:49,240
often mingle with stockbrokers, writers and truckers.

502
00:37:50,260 --> 00:37:53,480
We call this redneck golf, you know,

