00:37:53,481 --> 00:37:55,380
and it really does the same thing

504
00:37:55,381 --> 00:37:57,220
that golf or tennis do or something.

505
00:37:57,221 --> 00:38:00,420
It's a catharsis, you know, you get out there and you shoot

