00:38:05,601 --> 00:38:09,200
You know, you sort of imagine the target exploding,

509
00:38:09,201 --> 00:38:12,440
you don't even hear the gun go off, all that kind of stuff.

510
00:38:12,441 --> 00:38:16,880
And it's just a good, and it's great fellowship.

511
00:38:16,881 --> 00:38:20,420
You know, we're not real rifle shooters

512
00:38:20,421 --> 00:38:23,420
or pistol shooters here, we're mostly shotgun shooters.

513
00:38:25,640 --> 00:38:28,020
For those more serious about shooting,

514
00:38:28,021 --> 00:38:29,820
there is competition at every level

515
00:38:29,821 --> 00:38:32,060
for both men and women.

516
00:38:32,061 --> 00:38:34,220
Medals are awarded at the Olympic Games

517
00:38:34,221 --> 00:38:36,760
