575
00:42:11,261 --> 00:42:14,900
We have portraits of women, we have felines in the foreground,

576
00:42:14,901 --> 00:42:17,340
and we have very detailed birds.

577
00:42:17,341 --> 00:42:19,440
The time taken to make these engravings

578
00:42:19,441 --> 00:42:23,120
was about seven, eight months, including the sketches,

579
00:42:23,121 --> 00:42:26,020
the rendering of which took about three months.

580
00:42:26,021 --> 00:42:28,960
It's obviously a very particular hunting rifle.

581
00:42:28,961 --> 00:42:30,500
This was built for hunting,

582
00:42:30,501 --> 00:42:33,060
but I believe it's more for a collector.

583
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:40,560
Those with the inclination and the money

584
00:42:40,561 --> 00:42:45,280
can spend more than $100,000 for a shotgun.

585
00:42:45,281 --> 00:42:46,540
This is a Fabry.

586
00:42:46,541 --> 00:42:47,740
This is a 20 gauge.

