00:42:50,380 --> 00:42:52,220
It's an upland gun.

589
00:42:52,221 --> 00:42:53,780
This is the best gun made today.

590
00:42:53,781 --> 00:42:58,580
This thing is made out of steels that are just so strong and so tough.

591
00:42:58,581 --> 00:43:02,300
And everything on this gun fits perfectly.

592
00:43:02,960 --> 00:43:07,800
They're a cross between a Stradivarius and the space shuttle.

593
00:43:08,480 --> 00:43:13,960
And they like to say that they'll make a gun that will last in use for a thousand years.

594
00:43:15,020 --> 00:43:17,880
Because they say the Roman Empire lasted a thousand years.

595
00:43:17,980 --> 00:43:21,060
So why can't we make a gun that will last for a thousand years?

596
00:43:21,061 --> 00:43:26,280
Whether it's necessary to make a gun that lasts a thousand years is another question.

597
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:29,180
But why not try?

598
00:43:34,040 --> 00:43:37,720
Since its royal beginnings more than 400 years ago,

599
00:43:38,220 --> 00:43:44,280
the shotgun has become the people's choice because of its versatility, simplicity and durability.

600
00:43:45,420 --> 00:43:50,100
From the New World, to the frontier towns of the American West,

601
00:43:50,101 --> 00:43:53,100
to the battlefields of Europe and Asia.

